# EPSON Perfection V39 / GT-S650 (04b8:013d): give the logged-in desktop
# user access (uaccess) and mark it as a SANE device so the stock SANE rules
# keep it powered.  Add GROUP="scanner" here if your distribution uses one.
ATTRS{idVendor}=="04b8", ATTRS{idProduct}=="013d", ENV{libsane_matched}="yes", MODE="0664", TAG+="uaccess"
